wip/ospray-studio: Import ospray-studio-1.1.0

OSPRay Studio is Intel's interactive scene graph viewer and batch
renderer built on OSPRay (wip/ospray).  The bundled small libraries
(ImGui, tinygltf, tinyexr, json, CLI11, ...) are used; benchmarking
support uses benchmarks/google-benchmark.

Off for now: the Python scene graph module (pybind11), OpenImageIO,
OpenEXR, OpenVDB and Draco support, MPI, and the plugins.
OSPRAY_INSTALL is off so the OSPRay libraries are not copied in.
